    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "text": "The mean of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> observations is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> and their variance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. If three of the observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>; then the value of the remaining two is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "9jdQB",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "7rWOP",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RCfdr",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "4gFSe",
      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Now <math><mn>12.4</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>62&#160;</mn></math><math><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Shifting of the origin to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;the equations will become&nbsp;</p><p><math><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Solving them and again will get the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;or</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p><p>But by shifting the origin back to original position, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>(or)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;the values of the remaining two are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>11</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
